<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://tianjiawen1.github.io/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://tianjiawen1.github.io/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2025-11-05T09:46:51+00:00</updated><id>https://tianjiawen1.github.io/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>A simple, whitespace theme for academics. Based on [*folio](https://github.com/bogoli/-folio) design. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">The Impact of Cameras on Model Performance</title><link href="https://tianjiawen1.github.io/blog/2025/camera/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="The Impact of Cameras on Model Performance"/><published>2025-10-30T00:00:10+00:00</published><updated>2025-10-30T00:00:10+00:00</updated><id>https://tianjiawen1.github.io/blog/2025/camera</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://tianjiawen1.github.io/blog/2025/camera/"><![CDATA[<p>在ByteMini机器人使用过程中，我们发现同样型号的机器人，在相同的环境中，roll out同一个模型，但性能差别非常大：成功率50%-80%。</p> <p>为此我们排查了所有的硬件区别，运动控制性能的区别，两个机器人的表现都非常接近，最后我们怀疑是相机的输入造成的。我们对比的了其他其他机器人左右手手上眼的图像，发现确实低成功率的一台机器人（404），其左手的图像FOV更大。</p> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/camera-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/camera-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/camera-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/camera.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mx-auto d-block" width="400" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <p>我们进一步排查了结构件的变形，安装位置等，均一致。最后尝试了更换相机，发现这个左手的图像和其他相机的图像更加接近了。这才知道即使是工业界成熟的相机，每台之间的FOV差异都很大。更换相机后再测试模型，发现性能也能和其他机器人的成功率一致。这也可以看出相机的FOV对模型的影响有多大。</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="work"/><category term="robot-problem-solving"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[How to Troubleshoot Robot Problems]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">doudou and jojo waiting for food</title><link href="https://tianjiawen1.github.io/blog/2025/dogs/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="doudou and jojo waiting for food"/><published>2025-10-23T11:12:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-10-23T11:12:00+00:00</updated><id>https://tianjiawen1.github.io/blog/2025/dogs</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://tianjiawen1.github.io/blog/2025/dogs/"><![CDATA[<p>my two dogs, whose name is doudou and jojo.</p> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/dogs-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/dogs-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/dogs-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/dogs.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mx-auto d-block" width="600" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="life"/><category term="dogs"/><category term="image"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[a picture for doudou and jojo]]></summary></entry></feed>